/target
# Personal, machine-local build-output redirect (e.g. when the default drive is full) -- never
# committed; each dev/agent's own path is their own business.
/.cargo/config.toml
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig
# GF compiler build artifacts (rust/crates/pg-realize/gf/ — gen_templates.py / gf --make output).
*.gfo
# .NET build artifacts for the dotnet-harness project (not Rust, but shares this repo).
dotnet-harness/**/obj/
dotnet-harness/**/bin/
# Corpus/golden artifacts produced by the parity harness stay untracked (see rust-conversion.md §8).
/parity-out/
*.tsv
# ...but conformance fixtures' oracle-generated expectations are tests, not scratch — keep them tracked.
!/conformance/**/expected.tsv
